  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x93;Combating climate change in agriculture programme (Mex-3CAP)&#x94;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims at enhancing Mexicos capacity to optimize the use of its natural resources and to combat climate change (reduction of GHG emissions, carbon sequestration and improvement of resilience to climate variability) by promoting sustainable activities in the following priority sectors: agriculture, fisheries, livestock and forestry.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
